      "description": "Real-work workflow pack — the Research cluster: turn a question into a short, cited web brief. Rides the unified web search (core.web.search → the host.webResearch surface): live results when a search key is configured (BYOK secret 'web-search' on the keys page, or the host's OPENWOP_WEBSEARCH_API_KEY), an honest demo placeholder when not — the synthesis says so plainly instead of pretending. For deep, multi-source, long-horizon research use the Deep Research AGENT in chat; this chain is the quick-brief shape. All tenant values are run parameters (replay-deterministic).",
